SUMMARY:Mixed-Level Improv Class with Carrie Caudle
DESCRIPTION:Mixed-Level Improv provides a deep dive into the core of improvisation–being spontaneous\, embracing risk-taking\, building confidence\, and being part of a supportive team. No prior improv experience is required\, and all types of learners are supported in this ensemble-building environment. \nThis four-week series class is open to students ages 18-98. All that is required is an open mind and the desire to play and be in the moment. Carrie will guide you through the rest. Give yourself the gift of play and presence! \n–> To finalize your sign-up\, please Venmo your $200 payment @carriecaudle (If you don’t have Venmo\, you can email carrieyucaudle@gmail.com or call/text 707-338-1364 and we will come up with a plan.)
URL:https://www.pollyklaastheater.org/event/mixed-level-improv-class-with-carrie-caudle/2026-09-22/
LOCATION:Polly Klaas Community Theater\, 417 Western Avenue\, Petaluma\, CA\, 94952\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.pollyklaastheater.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/mixed-level-improv-Sept22-Oct13-2026.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Carrie Caudle":MAILTO:carrieyucaudle@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
